He is fast and deals an enormous amount of damage, so if you are having trouble beating him, you can run back down the steps and into the water, as he will stand at the edge and be unable to attack you. [[Skyrim:Potions#Poisons|Poison potions]] will significantly help the battle against him and with the right potions may end the battle immediately or greatly shorten the length of the battle. Fire spells work particularly well against him, as do ranged attacks. You do not need to initiate conversation in order to earn entrance.

Inside, you are greeted by [[Skyrim:Ysgramor|Ysgramor]], founder of the [[Skyrim:Companions|Companions]] and harbinger of men, who asks you to speak to the Nord heroes of old who battled Alduin (as seen in the Elder Scroll): [[Skyrim:Gormlaith Golden-Hilt|Gormlaith Golden-Hilt]], [[Skyrim:Hakon One-Eye|Hakon One-Eye]], and [[Skyrim:Felldir the Old|Felldir the Old]]. The Hall is filled with [[Skyrim:Hero of Sovngarde|Heroes of Sovngarde]], including some very notable ones like [[Skyrim:Jurgen Windcaller|Jurgen Windcaller]], [[Skyrim:Olaf One-Eye|Olaf One-Eye]], and [[Skyrim:Ulfgar the Unending|Ulfgar the Unending]]. When you meet with the three heroes that you are directed towards, they decide to join Shouts with you to clear the mist from Sovngarde. The quest ends with you running out to join them near the misty valley.

== Notes ==
* It is possible to jump onto a rock hanging over the waterfall and make Tsun fall to his death, or shove him off the platform with Unrelenting Force. However, he will merely respawn in front of the Hall of Valor. On your way to the hall of Valor, he may stop you on the bridge and congratulate you.
* If you try to cross the bridge before Tsun grants access, you will be killed by lightning strikes.
* If you try to climb down the mountain around the Hall (on either side) you will be instantly killed if you go below a certain height.
* On the tables in the Hall of Valor, you can find a [[Skyrim:Roasted Ox Head|Roasted Ox Head]] and two [[Skyrim:Roasted Ox Leg|Roasted Ox Leg]]s, the only ones available in the game which you can take.

